1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,770
Turning an object inside a robot hand changes several contacts at once.
物体在手里转动时，多处接触同时变化。

2
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:11,810
This paper asks whether a compact physics model can plan those changes quickly, without learning a policy.
这篇用紧凑物理模型快速规划，不先训练策略。

3
00:00:12,541 --> 00:00:16,981
A contact can push an object, but cannot pull it through an empty gap.
接触可以推物体，隔着空隙却不能拉。

4
00:00:17,301 --> 00:00:24,541
Encoding these switching conditions directly makes trajectory optimization difficult as the number of possible contacts grows.
直接编码这些切换条件，会让多接触优化很难。

5
00:00:25,273 --> 00:00:30,273
Look at the green displacement: that is where external forces would move the object.
绿色位移表示物体在外力下原本怎样动。

6
00:00:30,573 --> 00:00:36,353
The model adds a contact correction, then smooths the calculation so an optimizer can use derivatives.
再加入接触修正并平滑计算，供优化器求导。

7
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:42,490
Model predictive control searches for short sequences of finger displacements toward the target.
模型预测控制搜索趋向目标的短时指尖动作。

8
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:49,030
It executes the next command, reads the updated state, and replans instead of trusting one long prediction.
执行下一步、读取状态，再重新规划。

9
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:55,340
The experiments use seventeen object shapes with both TriFinger and Allegro in MuJoCo.
在仿真中，两种手分别测试十七种形状。

10
00:00:55,800 --> 00:01:03,360
Known geometry and simulator states supply contact distances and Jacobians; no real camera tracking system is evaluated.
几何与状态已知，没有评测真实相机追踪。

11
00:01:04,008 --> 00:01:10,808
TriFinger success allows twenty millimeters of position error and roughly twenty-three degrees of orientation error.
成功允许二十毫米位置和约二十三度角误差。

12
00:01:11,228 --> 00:01:16,568
The conditions must hold for twenty consecutive rollout steps, rather than one lucky instant.
还要连续满足二十步，不能只瞬间接近。

13
00:01:17,252 --> 00:01:22,952
The reported TriFinger success rate is ninety-seven percent under that simulation protocol.
在该仿真协议下，成功率为百分之九十七。

14
00:01:23,472 --> 00:01:30,052
Its mean final position error is six point seven millimeters, while mean orientation error is about twelve degrees.
平均终态位置误差六点七毫米，角误差约十二度。

15
00:01:30,730 --> 00:01:36,070
Local contact geometry can miss the global consequences of an asymmetric shape.
局部接触几何可能漏掉非对称形状的全局影响。

16
00:01:36,630 --> 00:01:45,030
Some self-collision constraints are also incomplete; fast optimization does not establish reliable operation on an unseen physical object.
自碰撞约束也不完整，真机泛化仍需验证。

17
00:01:45,605 --> 00:01:53,305
The practical contribution is making contact-aware planning computationally manageable with a compact differentiable model.
贡献是用紧凑可微模型，让接触规划算得动。

18
00:01:53,745 --> 00:02:02,305
For deployment, the remaining work includes state estimation, geometry uncertainty, and validating the chosen success tolerances on hardware.
落地还需状态估计、几何不确定性和真机验证。
